425e15e7 (879 1793325570329 "guenchi" (("4gm4c2jr" . 3240) ("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing spawns2") (src . "test: the change-stream guard names the daemon program by a define the spawn reading sees\n\nentry-split's SPAWNS-2 tripwire reads every daemon spawn in a fixture and\nrequires it to name theourgiad.sc. The change-stream guard's spawn in start!\ntook the program path from a helper that assembled it, so the reading saw a\nspawn naming nothing. The program is now a define, daemon-file, relative to\nthe library root the helper locates, and the spawn names it through that\ndefine. Rows-baseline updated for the guard's line count.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 529))))
